        "s": "Write the after-tax WACC, and state exactly how much it differs from the pre-tax WACC and where each is used.",
        "f": "<b>r<sub>wacc</sub> = (E/V)·r<sub>E</sub> + (D/V)·r<sub>D</sub>(1 − τ<sub>c</sub>)</b><br><b>pre-tax WACC = (E/V)·r<sub>E</sub> + (D/V)·r<sub>D</sub> = r<sub>U</sub></b><br><br><b>The gap is exactly (D/V)·r<sub>D</sub>·τ<sub>c</sub></b> — the per-krone value of the interest tax shield.<br><br><b>Where each goes:</b><br>• <b>r<sub>wacc</sub></b> discounts free cash flows in the WACC method, because FCF was computed before interest and therefore ignores the shield.<br>• <b>r<sub>U</sub></b> discounts the unlevered firm in APV, where the shield is added back as a separate term.<br><br>Using the wrong one either double-counts the tax shield or drops it entirely.",
